WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.266 --> 00:00:03.955
- It was literally
everywhere but the toilet.

00:00:03.955 --> 00:00:06.538
(upbeat music)

00:00:09.156 --> 00:00:11.579
- I worked at a Victoria's
Secret throughout college.

00:00:11.579 --> 00:00:14.818
One time, this very sweet
old lady came into the store

00:00:14.818 --> 00:00:19.329
and had an accident and
just pooped on the floor.

00:00:19.329 --> 00:00:21.639
And my manager had to clean it up,

00:00:21.639 --> 00:00:23.763
and Spencer Pratt came in once.

00:00:23.763 --> 00:00:25.665
- So, I got a job at the
Express at the Del Amo Mall.

00:00:25.665 --> 00:00:28.099
And I keep getting
assigned to the jean wall.

00:00:28.099 --> 00:00:29.422
There's a whole method to it,

00:00:29.422 --> 00:00:31.341
you have to fold it in threes and then.

00:00:31.341 --> 00:00:32.898
So, I'm folding it and
I overhear my coworker

00:00:32.898 --> 00:00:36.641
compliment my folding job to my manager,

00:00:36.641 --> 00:00:39.753
and I overhear my manager respond, "well,

00:00:39.753 --> 00:00:43.385
"you know those Asians are
really good at origami."

00:00:43.385 --> 00:00:46.435
- I used to work at a
candle shop in Sydney,

00:00:46.435 --> 00:00:49.829
and one day I went to open
the store as I normally would,

00:00:49.829 --> 00:00:52.568
and underneath the door was this little

00:00:52.568 --> 00:00:55.256
love heart-shaped USB and a note,

00:00:55.256 --> 00:00:58.845
so I picked it up and it
said to the girl with the hat

00:00:58.845 --> 00:01:00.254
and it was a love letter,

00:01:00.254 --> 00:01:04.099
and I put the USB in and
it was a PJ Harvey song,

00:01:04.099 --> 00:01:07.795
The Perfect Day, and I
never found out who it was.

00:01:07.795 --> 00:01:10.679
- So, in high school,
I worked at Blockbuster

00:01:10.679 --> 00:01:12.268
which makes me seem really old,

00:01:12.268 --> 00:01:13.688
but it wasn't that long ago.

00:01:13.688 --> 00:01:18.205
And this guy would call all
the time asking for porn

00:01:18.205 --> 00:01:19.918
and we could tell it was the same guy.

00:01:19.918 --> 00:01:22.059
Most of the time, we
would just have to say,

00:01:22.059 --> 00:01:24.691
I'm sorry sir, this is a family store,

00:01:24.691 --> 00:01:26.690
and his response would be,

00:01:26.690 --> 00:01:29.456
"what about this family of sperm?"

00:01:29.456 --> 00:01:30.834
And then he would hang up.

00:01:30.834 --> 00:01:32.326
- The store was huge and the bathrooms

00:01:32.326 --> 00:01:34.009
are in the back of the store.

00:01:34.009 --> 00:01:37.014
And there was this wafting smell growing,

00:01:37.014 --> 00:01:39.352
and we had gotten so many
complaints from customers

00:01:39.352 --> 00:01:41.940
that we're like okay, let's see
what this nonsense is about.

00:01:41.940 --> 00:01:44.616
And it was like that movie The Shining

00:01:44.616 --> 00:01:47.854
where there's so much
blood all over the place.

00:01:47.854 --> 00:01:52.749
Well, just replace all the
redness with brown chunky poo.

00:01:52.749 --> 00:01:55.786
- My manager at Abercrombie
was a woman who I think was,

00:01:55.786 --> 00:01:58.099
she seemed 20 years older than me,

00:01:58.099 --> 00:02:00.164
she was probably three
years older than me.

00:02:00.164 --> 00:02:02.305
And the most distinct
thing I remember happening

00:02:02.305 --> 00:02:04.888
is one day I was eating
an apple and she said

00:02:04.888 --> 00:02:06.126
what does that taste like?

00:02:06.126 --> 00:02:07.961
And I said, an apple?

00:02:07.961 --> 00:02:10.583
And she said yeah, I've never had one.

00:02:10.583 --> 00:02:12.304
She was later arrested, I believe,

00:02:12.304 --> 00:02:15.117
for stealing thousands of
dollars worth of clothes

00:02:15.117 --> 00:02:16.450
for her nephews.

